          <div class="dossier-main">
            <div class="dossier-copy">
              <h3>Digital Cockpit Copilot<span class="title-slash">/</span><br />Manual RAG without hallucinations</h3>
              <p class="project-summary">When a driver asks "Why is warning light 14 blinking?" on the highway, the car can't afford a 3-second delay or an invented answer. We built an in-cockpit voice assistant for Android Automotive OS to query 84 dense vehicle service manuals. The real challenge wasn't standard text search—it was wiring schematics and fuse tables where plain vector search completely falls flat.</p>
              <a class="text-link" href="#project-notes">
                Read the technical breakdown
                <svg class="icon-inline" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 2.5V9.5M2.5 6L6 9.5L9.5 6"/></svg>
              </a>
            </div>

            <figure class="system-map">
              <figcaption class="map-caption mono">System architecture &amp; data flow</figcaption>
              <div class="map-canvas" role="img" aria-label="Flow from 84 vehicle manuals through hybrid retrieval and reranking to cited cockpit voice response">
                <div class="map-source">
                  <span class="map-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
                  <span>84 PDF manuals<br />+ RapidOCR</span>
                </div>
                <span class="map-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <div class="map-process">
                  <span class="map-process-label mono">HYBRID SEARCH + RERANK</span>
                  <span>BM25 + ChromaDB</span>
                  <small>Cross-Encoder <b>+</b> RRF</small>
                </div>
                <span class="map-line map-line-short" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <div class="map-output">
                  <span class="output-check" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2.5 6.5L4.5 8.5L9.5 3.5"/></svg>
                  </span>
